<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Case Study: Cue Health - Revenue Automation & Compliance</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: slideUp 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .section:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: #1e3c72;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #4facfe;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -3px;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #00f2fe;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .section p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .challenges ul, .actions ol {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .challenges li {
            background: #fff5f5;
            border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .challenges li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .material-weakness {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffebee 0%, #fce4ec 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #d32f2f;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .actions li {
            background: #f0f9ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #4facfe;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            counter-increment: action-counter;
        }

        .actions {
            counter-reset: action-counter;
        }

        .actions li::before {
            content: counter(action-counter);
            background: #4facfe;
            color: white;
            width: 25px;
            height: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-right: 10px;
            float: left;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .actions li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .results {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
        }

        .results ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .results li {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .results li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .testimonial {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd 0%, #ffeaa7 100%);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .testimonial::before {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 6rem;
            color: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.3);
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            left: 20px;
            font-family: serif;
        }

        .testimonial p {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .testimonial .author {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #856404;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .metric-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
            display: block;
        }

        .metric-label {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .back-link {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #1e3c72;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            background: #4facfe;
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .volume-indicator {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            border: 2px solid #2196f3;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1565c0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                margin: 10px;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
            
            .header {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            
            .section {
                padding: 20px;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
            }
            
            .back-link {
                position: static;
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="#" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Case Study: Cue Health</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Revenue Automation & Compliance Remediation</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Client Profile</h2>
                <p>Publicly listed healthcare-diagnostics company with high-volume e-commerce and B2B channels operating on NetSuite OneWorld.</p>
                <div class="volume-indicator">
                    >100K transactions per week
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>My Role</h2>
                <p><strong>Solution Architect / Director of Financial Systems</strong> – engaged to eliminate manual revenue processes, remediate a material SoD weakness, and institute change-governance for sustainable scale.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section challenges">
                <h2>Key Challenges</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Manual revenue schedules for complex bundled SKUs; finance buried in spreadsheet adjustments</li>
                    <li class="material-weakness">Recent audit cited a <span class="highlight">material weakness</span> in Segregation of Duties</li>
                    <li>No formal governance for system enhancements; uncontrolled changes reaching production</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Actions Taken</h2>
                <ol class="actions">
                    <li><strong>Advanced Revenue Management (ARM) Automation:</strong> Designed and deployed automated ARM templates covering 100% of sales orders, subscriptions, and bundle renewals—<span class="highlight">zero manual touches</span> post-go-live.</li>
                    <li><strong>Segregation-of-Duties Remediation:</strong> Partnered with an external advisory team to implement Strongpoint's SoD engine, realign roles/permissions, and resolve <span class="highlight">1,200 conflict lines</span>; walkthroughs with auditors cleared the material weakness in the next audit cycle.</li>
                    <li><strong>Change-Governance Framework:</strong> Built Jira-based CAB workflow with stage-gate reviews, test-script library, and release calendar; every enhancement now has documented requirements, estimates, and sign-offs.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section results">
                <h2>Results</h2>
                <div class="metrics">
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">0</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Manual Revenue Processes</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">80</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Staff Hours Saved/Month</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">1,200</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">SoD Conflicts Resolved</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">>90%</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Changes Follow CAB Process</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Eliminated all manual revenue-schedule work,</strong> saving ~80 staff hours per month and freeing the revenue team to focus on analysis</li>
                    <li><strong>Material weakness closed;</strong> audit opinion restored to unqualified</li>
                    <li>Governance model adopted by IT & Finance; <strong>>90% of changes</strong> now follow documented CAB process</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section testimonial">
                <h2>Client Testimonial</h2>
                <p>"I had the pleasure of working closely with Gabriel on a Strongpoint segregation of duties integration into NetSuite. Gabriel has excellent knowledge of NetSuite and was able to quickly work through over 1,200 lines of conflicts identified, while also creating new roles and permissions as well as mapping out mitigating control activities. Gabriel worked very well with all the teams providing high-quality professional services. I am looking forward to working with Gabriel again. Thank you for the great work!"</p>
                <p class="author">– John T. Marshall, Financial Executive Leader, Cue Health</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
